abstract: >-
  Code for the typification, statistical evaluation, and visualisation of
  non-metallic inclusion data from the industrial secondary refining of an
  Al-killed, Ca-treated, low-S linepipe steel. Includes ternary kernel density
  estimation of inclusion compositions, non-parametric size comparisons with
  effect sizes and multiple-comparison correction, and the figure code for the
  associated publication.
keywords:
  - calcium modification
  - calcium aluminates
  - secondary refining
  - automated SEM-EDS
  - steel cleanness
